### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Flooded Road" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :description "Flooded roadway with standing water and poor visibility at night" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Standing water on road surface, creating a reflective hazard" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Dark nighttime conditions with limited visibility" .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Hydroplaning risk due to standing water on road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reflective water surface causing visual occlusion of road markers and distant objects" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

